{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:97562","published":"2026-11-13T06:05:11.003704Z","modified":"2026-11-13T06:30:02.510744669Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-33811","CVE-2026-41567"],"summary":"Important: skopeo security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The skopeo command lets you inspect images from container image registries, get images and image layers, and use signatures to create and verify files. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* net: golang: Go net package: Denial of Service via long CNAME response in LookupCNAME (CVE-2026-33811)\n\n* docker: Moby/Docker Engine: Arbitrary Code Execution via malicious container image and compressed archive upload (CVE-2026-41567)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update skopeo to 1.22.2 [rhel-9.9] (JIRA:Rocky Linux-170520)\n\n* update to the latest upstream release (JIRA:Rocky Linux-185740)\n\n* switch skopeo to sustaining-engineering GitLab release-1.22 branch and bump epoch (JIRA:Rocky Linux-220456)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nAdditional Changes:\n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the Rocky Linux 9 Release Notes linked from the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"skopeo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/skopeo?distro=rocky-linux-9&epoch=3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:1.22.2-4.el9"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:97562.json"}},{"package":{"name":"skopeo-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/skopeo-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-9&epoch=3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:1.22.2-4.el9"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"http